<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">1 Peter</book>
  <para style="h">1 Peter</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Peter</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Peter</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Peter</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu Khris’ sawltahpi keima Peter in, Pontius gam, Galatia gam, Cappadocia gam, Asia gam, le Bithynia gamte-ah galtai-a a Kithethang Mite kungah lai kang hlah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pa Pasien in a sekholsa le a teelsa mite, Jesu Khris’ thu a mang ding le a sisan tawh a kithe dinga Hlagau Siengtho in a siensuosa mite tungah: Hepina le kilemna a kicingin hing om taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I Topa Jesu Khris’ Pa le Pasien in thupha nga taheh! Ama’ ei khuotuona lienpi ziehin sina panin Jesu Khris’ thawkiana tungtawnin ahing lametna a nei dingin eite a tha-in ei suohsah zo a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />note adingin vantungah a kisie thei lo, a buabang lo, le a vul thei lo na gouluo ding uh ang kikoipieh zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Note pen upna tungtawnin hun nukhia ciengin a kilang dinga a baisa-a a om hutdamna a nga dingin Pasien’ vanglietna tawh ang kikemcingte na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tu-in note in bakhat sung hahsatna tuomtuomte na thuoh pah zongun, tami thu-ah lungdam un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tua in mei tawh a kisittel zaw cienga a kisie thei kham sanga a manphazaw na upna tahtah uh hing kilangsahin, Jesu Khris ang kilaa ciengin phatna, minthanna le patawina na nga thei nading uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama mu ngai lo napi na it uhi; tu-in ama mu sih nan locin na um vua gen zawh lo za dongin kipahin nahpi tahin na lungdam uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />azieh pen na upna uh’ tupna bulpi ahi na hlagau uh’ kihutdamna a nga na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tami hutdamna tawh kisai-in note nga ding hepina thu a genkhol kamsangte in limtahin sui-in a kantel vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />amate sunga om Khris’ Hlagau in Khris’ thuoh dinga a kisesa teng le tua zaw cienga a nga ding minthanna thu teci a pankhol lai-in, koi a cina ahi a, bang hun ding ahei ci-in a kan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Vantung pana ang kisawl Hlagau Siengtho tawh note tunga lungdamna thu ang hil mite in na kung vuah tu-a ang kigensa thute ang hil lai-un, amau’ na sem hi loin note’ na sem ahi lam amate tungah a kilah zo hi, tam thute pen vantung mite nangawn in a mu nop uh thu ahi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin nasem dingin na lungsim uh a kigingsa-in om un; no le no pilvang unlen, Jesu Khris ang kilah hun cienga ang kipie ding hepina tungah na lametna uh nga un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thumang tate ma bangin bangma na thei lo uh hun lai-a na lunggulnate vuah buol nawn sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Note ang hlan pa a siengtho ahi ma bangin no zong na gamtatna zosie vuah na siengtho un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Azieh pen, “Kei a siengtho ka hi ziehin note zong na siengtho ding uhi,” ci-in kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A gamtatnate utawh kizui-in mi zosie tungah deidat nei lo-a thu a khen pa tungah Pa bangin thu na nget uleh, na galtai uh hun sungin ama giingin gamta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na pu na pate uh tung pana na luosuh uh a ginalo gamtatna panin a kisie thei nate ahi ngun le khamte tawh ang kitan ahi sih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />mapawn nei lo le nuolbang lo tuuno tawh a kibang a manpha Khris’ sisan tawh ang kitan ahi lam na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama pen leitung pien masangin a kisekholsa hi a, ahi vangin note adingin hun nukhia cienga ang kilahsah pan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pasien tungah na upna ule na lametna uh a kingah thei nadingin, ama tungtawnin sina panin ama a thosah le minthanna a pie pa Pasien sungah muonna a nei na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tu-in note itna tahtah tawh khatlekhat na ki-it thei nading ule na lungtang tawng panun khatlekhat na ki-it thei nadingun thuman thutah zuina tawh na hlagau uh na siensuo zo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A kisie thei khaici tawh hi loin, a kisie thei lo khaici ahi, a hing le a kip a kho Pasien’ thu tawh a tha-a a suohkia na hi ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Azieh pen, “Mihing zosie lopa tawh kibang a, ama’ minthanna zosie zong lopa paa tawh kibang hi. Lopate vulin paate pul a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />ahi vangin Topa’ thu ahile a tawntungin kip hi,” a ci hi. Tami thu in na kung vua ang kigensa lungdamna thu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin gitlona zosie, mi solna zosie, thangsietna le kigensietna zosie paimang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hutdamna ah na khangliet thei nadingun nausen suohcilte bangin hlagau lam nawizu siengtho na lunggul un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Note in Topa a hoi lam na ciem zo tahtah ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mite in a nuolsa ahi vangin Pasien muna-ah manpha hi, ci-a a teel tua a hing suongpi ahi ama kungah hing pei unlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />note zong Jesu Khris tungtawnin Pasien’ san thei dingin hlagau tawh kisai biehpiehna a bawl ding le a siengtho siempu nam ahi dingin noma le noma hlagau innpi kilamna-a kizang a hing suongte bang na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Azieh pen Lai Siengtho sungah, “En un, a kiteel a manpha innkiu suong khat, Zion ah ka koi hi, ama a um mi poma kimaizumsah lo ding hi,” kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin no a um mite adingin ama manpha a, ahi vangin a um lo mite adingin ahile, “Inn lamte’ nilkhiet suong, innkiu suong bulpi a suoh zo hi,”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />a cina le, “Amate a kipalsah suong le a puasah suong khat a suoh hi,” a ci hi. Azieh pen amate in thu a man lo ziehun a kipalpua uhi, bangzieh ahei cile tua bang ding ma-a laitansa ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi vangin note na hi uleh khuomiel panin a lamdang ama’ khuovah sungah ang hlan pa’ nasepna lamdangte a phuongzah dinga ang kiteeltuom minam, kumpi siempu nam, a siengtho minam, le Pasien’ mite na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hun khat lai-in minam hi sih nan locin, tu-in Pasien’ mi na hi ta uhi; hun khat lai-in khuotuona nga sih nan locin, tu-in khuotuona na nga zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka itte aw, na hlagau uh ang do den cilesa’ deinate panin na kideh zo nadingun pemtate le galtaite bangin note tungah kang thum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Gentile-te in sietna bawlte ci-in ang minsietsah vangun, thukhen dinga Pasien ang pei ciengin amate in note’ gamtat hoite mu-in Pasien’ min a phat thei nadingun amate lahah zatah huoi-in na gamta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa vang tawh mihingte in a koi aana nei zosie’ thu na mang un. Thunei pen ahi kumpipa’ thu ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a khielte gawtin a dihtatte a phat dinga ama in a sawl uhpite thu ahi zongin na mang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile note in sil hoi na sepna uh ziehin bangma thei lo mimawte na sipsah ding uh pen Pasien’ deina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A suohta mite bangin nungta un, hizongle gitlo sel nading po-in na suotahna uh na zang sih unlen, Pasien’ nasemte bangin na nungta zaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi zosie na zatah un. Thu um innkuonte na it un. Pasien zong giingin kumpi pa zong na zatah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Silate aw, zatahna kici zosie tawh na pute uh’ thu na mang un. A thusiem le a nunnemte’ thu beh hi loin, a gilo na pute uh’ thu zong na mang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Azieh pen note in Pasien theina tawh a dih lopi-in gentheina na thuoh laitahun na thuoh zawh uleh patahna a nga na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na tatkhielna ziehun ang kisat ciengin na thuoh zawh uleh bang patahna om ding ahei? Hizongle note in sil hoi semin gimna na thuoh ciengun na thuoh zawh uleh Pasien’ thukimna a nga na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tam ding ma-a note ang kihlan ahi hi. Azieh pen Khris in note adingin na thuoh zo a, tuaci’n ama’ ketot teng na zui thei dingun ette ding lim ang nuasie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Ama in mawna bawl lo a, a kam sungah zuouthu kimu lo hi,”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama a kihosiet ciengin hosietna ma tawh thuhkia lo a, gimna a thuoh ciengin zong koima galgih tuon lo hi; hinanle dih taha thukhen pa tungah ama le ama a ki-apzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mawnate panin eite suohta-in dihna adinga i nuntah thei nadingin amama in ama’ pumpi tawh singlamte tungah eite’ mawna a puo hi. Ama’ liemnate ziehin note na dam zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Azieh pen note tuu bangin lam na piel vua hinanle tu-in na hlagaute uh ang kem le ang cing pa kungah nang kilekia uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ma bangin zite aw, na pasalte’ uhna na mang un. Tua hileh amate kimkhat in Pasien’ thu mang sih nan ule, a zite uh’ gamtatzie,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a siengtho le a zatahhuoi a hinkhuote uh a mu uh ciengin, kam khat zong ham kul sese loin amate kizo thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Note’ kizepna pen samtumna, kham kizepna, le puonsil hoi nono silnate ahi putham kizepnate hi loin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pasien mai-ah a manpha mama, a tul thei lo hoina ahi lungnemna le lungsim dai dide tawh na sunglam hinna uh na zemzaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tanglai Pasien um numei siengthote zong tam bangin kizemin a pasalte’ uhna a na mang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua bangin Sarah in zong Abraham’ thu mangin ‘topa’ na ci hi. Note zong a hoi-in gamta-in patauna dipkuotna na nei lo laisie uh Sarah’ tanute na hi ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua bang ma-in no pasalte aw, na thungetnate uh bangma in ang khahtan lo nadingin, na zite utawh hinkhuo na mantonna vuah amate zong hepina zieha hinna letsong luote ahi tah ziehun, no sanga a thanem zawte ahi lam uh theisiemin amate na zatah bawl un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A tawpna-ah, note in na unpi-un lungsim kihuolna, khuotuona, khatlekhat ki-itna, lungnemna, le lungsim kiniemkhiehna nei ciet un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gitlona pen gitlona tawh thuhkia loin, hosietna zong hosietna tawh thuhkia sih un; tuale mahin thupha tawh na thuhkia zaw un. Note in thupha khat na nga thei nadingun tam dinga ang kihlan na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azieh pen, “Hinna a it mite le ni hoite a mu nuom mite in gitlona panin a leii uh kemin, zuou genna panin a kam uh kem ta uheh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />gitlona panin amate kihei-in, a pha bawl uheh; amate in kilemna sui-in tua kilemna thu del ta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa’ mit in midihte en a, amate thungetna zong a bil a daw hi. Hinanle gitlona a bawl mite Topa in a huo hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu-in a pha bawl ding lawp mama hi locin, koi in no hing bawlsie ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin sil hoi bawl ziehin gimna na thuoh ule zong, thupha na nga ding uhi. Amau’ giinte giing sih unlen, zau seng sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanle na lungsim sung vuah Khris pen Topa bangin zatah un. Na sung vua om lametna thu ang dong popo a hilcien thei dingin a kigingsa-in om zing un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />hizongle lungnemna le zatahna tawh gen un. Khris sunga na gamtat hoina uh a gensiete in ang hosiet ciengin a maizum thei nadingun, na lungsim vuah kisuonna a om lo dingin a siengtho-in na om un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Azieh pen thuohna khu Pasien’ deina ahile, a sie bawlna zieha thuohna sangin a pha bawlna zieha thuohna hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Pasien kungah note ang tut thei nadingin, midih ahi Khris in zong mawnate ziehin midih lote adingin a kimang den dingin khatvei gimna a thuoh hi. Ama in cilesa tawh sina a thuoh vangin hlagau tawh kihingsah kia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama zong tua hlagau tawh pei-in thong sunga om hlagaute tungah thu a va hil ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuate pen nidang lai, Noah in tembawpi a bawl hun lai-a Pasien in lungduoi taha a na nga ngetngut thumang lo hlate ahi uhi. Tua tembawpi sungah mi themkhat, mi giet beh, tui in a suohtasah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tami tui in tu-a no ang hunkhie tuiphumna etsahna hi a, pumpi tahsa ciniehte silsiengna bang hi loin, Jesu Khris thawkiana tungtawnin sielepha theina lungsim hoi nei thei nadinga Pasien tunga thumna hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua Jesu Khris pen vantungah a pei zo ta a, Pasien’ zietlamah omin ama’ thuneina nei-ah vantung mite, uhna neite, vanglietna neite zosie a om uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Khris in cilesa sungah gimna a thuoh lang kalsie, no mama in zong tua bang ngaisutna ma tawh na kigalging un. (Azieh pen cilesa sunga gimna a thuoh poma mawna a tawpsan ahi ta hi).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaci’n a omlai na leisiet hinkhuote uh mihingte’ deina bangin hing nawn loin, Pasien’ deina banga a hing ding na hizaw ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Note in Gentile-te’ sep nop ahi thangtatna, huasanna, zukhamna, guolnopna, zu-uong dawnna, thukham palsat a milim biehnate ah na hun uh na zang sieng ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate tawh kibangin tua uongtat thanghuoina na zop nawn lo ciengun amate in lamdang sa-in ang gensie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in a hinglaite le a sisate’ thukhen dinga a kigingsa-a om pa mai-ah thudawhna a thuoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Azieh pen tami thu zieh ma-a misite kung nangawnah lungdamna thu a kitangko hi a, mi zosie thu kikhensa ahi ma bangin, amate zong cilesa sungah thukhensa hinan ule, Pasien ma bangin hlagau sungah a hin thei nading uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sil bangkim a tawp ding hun ang nai ta hi; tua ahi ziehin thu na nget thei nadingun no le no ki-uh zo le pilvang tahin na om un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua teng zosie banah note khatlekhat nahpi tahin na ki-it un; bangzieh ahei cile itna in mawna tampite a selcip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Phun vawt loin khatlekhat zin na kido un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasien’ hepina nam tuomtuom a zah siemte bangin note khat ciet in na nga uh ahi letsong popo tawh khatlekhat’ na na kiseppieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sil bangkim ah Jesu Khris tungtawnin Pasien’ min a than thei nadingin thu a gen tapo in Pasien’ kammal beh ma a genpa bangin gen taheh; na sem tapo in zong Pasien’ pieh thahatna tawh sem taheh. Tua hile Jesu Khris tungtawnin sil bangkim ah Pasien’ min a thang ding hi. Ama tungah minthanna le uhzawhna om den tawntung taheh. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka itte aw, na tung vuah ang sittel ding gimna meikuong ang tun ciengin sil lamdangpi khat ang tung dan bangin ngaisunin lamdangsa sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama’ minthanna ang kilah ciengin note zong lungdam kipahin na kiko thei nadingun, tu tanpha-in Khris’ thuohnate na thuohpina vuah na lungdamzaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khris’ min vangin note ang kihosiet leh a hampha na hi uhi, bangzieh ahei cile na tung vuah Pasien’ Hlagau ahi minthanna hlagau a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Note koima khat beh, tuolthat, guta, mawna lien bawl, ahi sihle thusie bawlte bangin gimna thuohte hi kha sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahi vangin note khatpo in Tapidaw hina zieha gimna na thuoh uleh zong maizumna-in ngaisun sih unlen, tami min na puoh ziehun Pasien na phatzaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Pasien’ innkuonpite tawh kipanin thukhen nading hun ang tung ta hi; tua pen eite tawh kipan ahile Pasien’ lungdamna thu a mang lo mite’ hun tawpna ding thu bang ahi ta diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuale “Midihte hutdam nading hamsa ahile, Pasien thei lote le mawneite bang a suoh ta ding vuoi?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Pasien’ deina tawh kituohin gimna a thuohte in a sil pha bawl uh zom suohin, ciem pel lo a Siempa tungah amau le amau ki-ap uheh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in keimama upa khat hi-in Khris’ thuohnate teci a pang pa, ang kilang ding minthanna zong a nga ding pa in note lahah a om upate kang hanthawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Note’ kep dinga ang kipie Pasien’ tuuhonte, pausawl thu tawh hi lo, a siengtho lo sum nga nopna tawh zong hi loin, Pasien in note ang dei bangin thanopna lungsim tawh na cingzaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Note’ kep dinga ang kipie tuuhonte uhcip sih unlen, tuuhonte’ ette na hizaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua hile tuucing pipa ang kilah ciengin note in a vul thei lo minthanna lukhu na nga ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ma bangin no a khangdawng zawdeute in a khanghamte’ thu na mang un. Na unpi-un khatlekhat tungah kiniemkhiehna puon bangin na sil un, azieh pen, “Pasien in mi kiphasahte langpan a, mi kiniemkhiehte hepina a pie hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin ama in pha a sah hun ciengin note ang lapsang thei nadingin a vanglien Pasien khut nei-ah noma le noma na kiniemkhieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in note ang don ziehin na lungkhamna zosie uh ama tungah nga un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />No le no ki-uh unlen khuo phawh un. Na galpa uh dawimangpa in koi ka valtum thei diei ci-in sui-in a hawh vapom humpinelkai bangin a vah kawikawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Leitung mun zosie-a om na sanggamte un zong note thuoh banga a thuoh ahina thu thei na hi ziehun, ama do unlen na upna vuah kip un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Note in gentheina bakhat sung na thuoh zaw ciengun Khris sungah tawntung minthanna nga dinga ang hlan pa, hepina zosie’ Pasien mama in note a ngaingai ang bangsah ding a, ama in hing panpi-in hing thahatsahin zong ang kipsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama tungah a tawntungin thuneina om den taheh. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Keima in sanggam muonhuoi khat a ka ngaituo Silvanus tungtawnin note hanthot nading le tam pen Pasien’ hepina tahtah ahina thu teci ka pan nadingin tami laihlah tomno kang giel ahi hi. Tua thu-ah kip un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Note tawh a kiteelton Babylon khuo-a om pawlpi mite in ang noset uhi. Ka tapa Mark in zong ang noset uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Note khatlekhat itna kinapna tawh na kinoset un. Note zosie tungah Khris sunga nopna hing om taheh.
  </para>
</usx>
